--- !u!114 &114338370570854470
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1112955406785082}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8848e1705d01974c5837347689cbeb1b, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  textSound: snd_txtsans
  fontName: sans
  greetMessage: '* heya.^10\n* how can i help\n  ya?'
  idleMessage: '* not really doing\n  anything else.'
  exitMessage: wink`* see ya later.
  buyGreet: whaddya \nwant?
  buySuccess: wink`thanks.
  buyReject: neutral`ya don't \nwant that?
  buyNoMoney: side`you don't \nhave the \nmoney.
  buyNoSpace: neutral`you're \ncarrying \ntoo much \nstuff.
  item1ID: 33
  item1price: 75
  item1ShortDesc: Changes AT\nwith HP
  item2ID: 34
  item2price: 80
  item2ShortDesc: Icicle that\nnever melts!
  item3ID: 35
  item3price: 30
  item3ShortDesc: Eat it twice!
  item4ID: 37
  item4price: 45
  item4ShortDesc: Q.C.'s recipe
  sellPrompt:
  - neutral`* hey,^05 i'm trying to get rid of\n  stuff,^05 not get more.
  - wink`* maybe if we get back to the\n  underground,^05 we can see if my\n  brother wants anything.
  - side`* well,^05 when we get back to\n  MY underground.
  talkGreet: wink`i can tell \nyou about \nshopping \nstuff.
  topic1: About yourself
  topic1lines:
  - wink`* hey,^05 i don't think i asked\n  what your name was.
  - closed`* ...^10 kris,^05 huh.
  - neutral`* that's cool.
  - wink`* i'm sans.^10\n* sans the skeleton.
  - closed`* but you already knew that.
  - closed`* and because you already\n  knew that,^05 i'm gonna tell you\n  something that you <color=#FFFF00FF>don't know</color>.
  - closed`* ...
  - side`* actually wait a sec,^05 we only\n  just met like an hour ago.
  - wink`* don't you know that friendship\n  takes time?
  - neutral`* besides,^05 don't you have\n  anything <color=#FFFF00FF>more important</color> to do?
  topic2: Doppelganger
  topic2lines:
  - closed`* have you heard of the\n  <color=#FFFF00FF>multiverse</color> before?
  - neutral`* it's something that sounds\n  really sci-fi,^05 but it's\n  literally happening around us\n  right now.
  - wink`* in fact,^05 it's something i've\n  studied pretty extensively ever\n  since coming here.
  - rolleye`* well,^05 when i came to where\n  i live,^05 i mean.
  - side`* uhh,^05 anyway.
  - closed`* because of the opportunity of\n  choice and variation,^05 there are\n  multiple ways that events can\n  play out, and the different\n  worlds we see are their impacts.
  - neutral`* they're known as <color=#FFFF00FF>alternate\n  universes</color>.
  - side`* if two of these universes are\n  only just slightly different,^05\n  but are otherwise similar,^05\n  then i call those two <color=#FFFF00FF>alternate\n  timelines</color>.
  - neutral`* in the case of this place,^05 i'd\n  say it's an alternate timeline\n  to the universe i live in.
  - closed`* it's...^10 obviously in a pretty\n  bad state.
  - closed`* and i'm sure i don't have to\n  tell you that it clearly\n  affected the me that lives here.
  - neutral`* huh?^10\n* why would the me from here be\n  so violent?
  - concerned`* ... we probably shouldn't talk\n  about that right now.
  topic3: ICESLASH Weapon?
  topic3lines:
  - neutral`* everyone loves new weaponry,^05\n  right?
  - side`* especially stuff that's useless\n  to most people.
  - rolleye`* like the icicle that i'm selling.
  - wink`* very weak SLASH weapon.^10\n* it's as powerful as plastic.
  - side`* but hey,^05 i did say "most\n  people."
  - neutral`* maybe noelle could see use\n  in it.
  - wink`* after all,^05 she does have <color=#FFFF00FF>ice\n  magic</color>.
  - side`* maybe she could harness its\n  coldness or something.^10\n* dunno.
  topic4: Royal Scientist
  topic4lines:
  - side`* alphys?^10\n* she's pretty cool.
  - wink`* very smart,^05 nice,^05 and cool.\n* not surprised she has such\n  a high position.
  - neutral`* she's helped me a lot\n  with stuff i wasn't really\n  knowledgeable on.
  - rolleye`* she's a bit of a dork.^10\n* really into anime and cartoons.
  - wink`* but hey,^05 aren't we all\n  a bit dorky?
  - side`* now why you'd think she\n  was a guy is beyond me.
  - neutral`* that'd be like me assuming\n  your gender,^05 kris.^10\n* it'd be pretty rude.
  - neutral`* unless you were referring\n  to an older royal scientist.
  - closed`* which is an unsolved case.
  - neutral`* i don't know much about\n  previous positions,^05 other than\n  they were responsible for\n  making the core.
  - side`* though at this point,^05 no\n  one cares about who made the\n  core,^05 just that it's being\n  maintained.
  - wink`* it's our only source of power,^05\n  after all.
  sellGreet: "What would \nyou like \nto sell?"
  sellSuccess: "Thanks for \nthat!"
  sellReject: "Changed your \nmind?"
  sellDeny: "We are \nnot accepting \nthat."
